#: src/driver.rs
msgid "DKMS backend unavailable: the lssbi_probe module is not loaded; run `sudo modprobe lssbi_probe`"
msgstr "DKMS 后端不可用：lssbi_probe 模块尚未加载；请运行 `sudo modprobe lssbi_probe`"

#: src/driver.rs
msgid "Invalid Linux CPU value \"{value}\": expected a non-negative decimal integer"
msgstr "Linux 处理器值 “{value}” 无效：应为非负十进制整数"

