msgid "Linux CPU #{cpu} exceeds the supported affinity range (maximum #{max})"
msgstr "Linux 处理器 #{cpu} 超出支持的处理器亲和性范围（最大编号为 #{max}）"

#: src/driver.rs
msgid "Linux CPU #{cpu} is not in this process's allowed CPU set; it may be offline or excluded by an affinity/cpuset restriction"
msgstr "Linux 处理器 #{cpu} 不可用：可能已离线，或不允许当前进程使用"

